      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im kinda worried about my partner. they have type 1 diabetes and they've been feeling really sick lately. they keep saying they're super thirsty and nauseous, and they're acting kind of confused too. my partner also said their breath smells weird... kind of like nail polish remover or something? i think they just need to drink a lot of water and sleep it off, right? do u think they should just take a nap?",
